ちょっとこの人うるさいんですけど。あくたんじまおっけー？
This person is kind of annoying. Is Akutan Island okay?

323
00:25:31,146 --> 00:25:35,386
ふふっ、二人とも緊張しなさすぎ！
Hehe, you two aren't nervous at all!

324
00:25:35,866 --> 00:25:37,086
よし、行こうか！
Alright, let's go!

325
00:26:03,667 --> 00:26:06,077
ずっと夢見てた僕になれたかな
I wonder if I became the me I always dreamed of being...

326
00:26:06,177 --> 00:26:08,657
とうに帰れないとこまで来みたい
having come to a place from which I can no longer return.

327
00:26:08,907 --> 00:26:13,187
自分の足で二段飛ばしてそうもっと先へ駆け出していけるはずだから ran away
Running away because I should be able to dash even further ahead by taking two steps at a time on my own feet.

328
00:26:13,467 --> 00:26:15,907
深くなる傷を縫い付け
Stitching up the deepening wounds,

329
00:26:16,117 --> 00:26:18,237
繋ぐパス軸に回り出す
spinning around on the connecting path's axis.

330
00:26:18,237 --> 00:26:23,087
慣れた痛み 焦る呼吸とビート 気付かないふりしてまた一人
Used to the pain, with hurried breath and beats, pretending not to notice as I'm all alone again.

331
00:26:23,187 --> 00:26:27,857
何が正当？ ないない永劫 誰が間違った対価払うの
What is right? There is no eternity. Who pays the wrong price?

332
00:26:27,857 --> 00:26:32,577
あんたが嫌いなあいつはきっと ただ「それだけ」で不正解なんだ
That person you hate so much is surely just "incorrect" for that very reason.

333
00:26:33,007 --> 00:26:37,047
0点だって提言したって全然納得できない理由も
Even if I propose it's zero points, the reason still isn't convincing at all.

334
00:26:37,147 --> 00:26:42,227
最前線はいつだってここだった 最善策は最初からなかった
The front line was always right here. The best solution was never there from the start.

335
00:26:42,397 --> 00:26:46,487
緩やかに崩れ壊れてく
Slowly and gently, it crumbles and breaks down.

336
00:26:46,767 --> 00:26:51,457
ゆりゆり首を締めるように昨日の僕が殺されていく
As if slowly, slowly choking, yesterday's me is being killed off.

337
00:26:51,607 --> 00:26:56,177
緩やかに離れ離れ飽く
Slowly and gently, drifting apart and growing weary.

338
00:26:56,317 --> 00:27:01,437
ぐらりんにきみにきこえるのは僕が知らない声になってく
Swaying, what reaches you turns into a voice I don't know.

339
00:27:11,447 --> 00:27:16,017
幼い頃から 気付いたら傍にいた
Ever since I was young, before I knew it, you were by my side,

340
00:27:16,017 --> 00:27:20,567
まるで空気のようだ 僕は君とぎゅっと手をつないで
just like air. I held your hand tightly,

341
00:27:20,567 --> 00:27:25,377
楽しいことも涙も 僕は君に話して聞かせた
and told you all about my happy moments and tears.

342
00:27:25,377 --> 00:27:30,237
僕を笑う人や蔑む声が聞こえぬように君は歌った
You sang so that the voices of people laughing at or despising me wouldn't reach me.

343
00:27:30,237 --> 00:27:35,117
この声を君が受信 また夜毎投影されてく憂い
You received this voice, and every night sorrows are projected.

344
00:27:35,117 --> 00:27:39,587
使い捨てだっていいって腐っても止まらないハイファイ、サイガイシト
Even if disposable or rotting, the unstoppable hi-fi zeitgeist—

345
00:27:39,817 --> 00:27:44,287
一周巡る間のたった一瞬だけでも交わる鼓動、音、繋ぐ色
Just for a fleeting moment in a full rotation, crossing heartbeats, sounds, connecting colors.

346
00:27:44,287 --> 00:27:49,287
次は僕が君に歌うから
Next time, I will sing for you.

347
00:27:49,457 --> 00:27:53,547
緩やかに崩れ壊れてく
Slowly and gently, it crumbles and breaks down.

