355
00:28:27,657 --> 00:28:32,487
いつか君に届くかな いやそんな日はきっと来ないだろうな
Will this reach you someday? No, that day will surely never come.

356
00:28:32,487 --> 00:28:37,417
声も体も持たぬ君に救われた数億人の一人
One of the hundreds of millions saved by you, who has no voice or body.

357
00:28:37,417 --> 00:28:42,147
赤青合わせ彩った音で世界が溢れた
The world overflowed with sounds colored in mixed red and blue.

358
00:28:42,147 --> 00:28:47,047
巡り巡り出会ったこの音を聴くすべてが
Everyone who listens to this sound we met through endless cycles...

359
